{
  "name": "\"Men's engagement crucial to women empowerment\", identifies award-winning paper by SONAM faculty",
  "parent_id": 203313789332670,
  "group_id": "bc18739b-cb20-4177-8da2-00fe6bb19b89",
  "alternates": [],
  "created_at": "2026-07-31T09:24:54.879Z",
  "deleted_at": null,
  "sort_by_date": null,
  "tag_list": [],
  "updated_at": "2026-07-31T09:24:54.959Z",
  "published_at": "2026-07-31T09:24:54.945Z",
  "id": 203982007858581,
  "uuid": "af05e492-5a38-4a2a-aca9-c2a016c59448",
  "is_folder": false,
  "content": {
    "_uid": "d8296033-e17f-7b36-eb3e-def26e18bd83",
    "body": [
      {
        "_uid": "90dd6648-c553-e3a2-2a35-b41a121f16d9",
        "content": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "In the first phase of the study, focus group discussions (FGDs) and key informant interviews were conducted throughout Pakistan to identify change-agents and the perception of communities regarding such initiatives. FGDs included BISP beneficiary couples, or couples belonging to similar socio-economic status across the four provinces. For the key informant interviews, BISP Beneficiary Committee members, provincial/district BISP representatives, social mobilisers, community workers, and healthcare professionals were included. ",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "The study identified men's involvement and engagement to be crucial in empowering women to partake in building life skills and other initiatives for their improved physical and mental well-being. Moreover, this research also developed a nation-wide LSB module to be implemented at a later stage. ",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "SONAM's Assistant Dean of Research, Dr Tazeen Saeed Ali and Dean Dr Rozina Karmaliani are the Co-Principal Investigators of this project that is still underway. ",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "The outcome of phase one of the study \"",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "text": "Community Stakeholders' Perspectives regarding Acceptability of a Life Skill Building Intervention to Empower Women in Pakistan,\"",
                  "type": "text",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "italic"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "text": " has been published and awarded the Research in Nursing & Health's Best Paper Award for the year 2020-2021, after being shortlisted from a competitive pool of research papers from across the world.",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
